Here is a self-contained HTML file that recreates the classic 1978 Taito Space Invaders arcade experience. It's a single-file implementation with inline CSS and JavaScript, featuring the iconic pixel art style, sound effects, and core gameplay mechanics.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Space Invaders (1978) – Arcade Cabinet</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        body {
            background: #1a0e00;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .cabinet {
            background: #2c1c0e;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #3d2a1a, #1f140a);
            border: 6px solid #b87a3a;
            border-radius: 20px 20px 10px 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), inset 0 0 20px #6b3f1a;
            padding: 25px 20px 20px 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            max-width: 780px;
            width: 100%;
            position: relative;
        }
        .cabinet::before {
            content: "SPACE INVADERS";
            display: block;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            color: #f0d8b0;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px #f0a030, 0 4px 0 #5a2e1a;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            word-break: break-word;
        }
        .screen-wrapper {
            background: #0a0a0a;
            border: 6px solid #3a2a1a;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 10px;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px #000, 0 0 0 2px #b87a3a;
            width: 100%;
        }
        canvas {
            display: block;
            background: #000;
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            aspect-ratio: 640 / 720;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px #1a0a00;
        }
        .controls {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px 40px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 10px 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: #1f140a;
            border-top: 3px solid #b87a3a;
        }
        .control-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .btn {
            background: #3a2a1a;
            border: 3px solid #b87a3a;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #f0d8b0;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #5a2e1a, inset 0 2px 5px #f0a030;
            transition: 0.05s;
            user-select: none;
        }
        .btn:active {
            transform: translateY(4px);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 #5a2e1a, inset 0 2px 5px #f0a030;
        }
        .btn-restart {
            background: #5a2e1a;
            border: 3px solid #f0d8b0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            width: auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            height: 50px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .info {
            color: #b87a3a;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 0 #2c1c0e;
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .info span {
            background: #0a0a0a;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: 2px solid #b87a3a;
            color: #f0d8b0;
            min-width: 50px;
            text-align: center;
        }
